{
  "id": 8860441968839,
  "title": "Personalized Reading Girl on Book with Flowers Blanket - Book Lover",
  "handle": "personalized-reading-girl-on-book-with-flowers-blanket-book-lover",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in the comfort of a good book with our personalized reading blanket from Jeminise. This custom blanket is designed for every book lover, making it a thoughtful gift for friends, family, or yourself, and is perfect for cozy reading sessions.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Book Lover Gift:</strong> A thoughtful and personal gift that any book lover will cherish, perfect for showing off their love of reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make it truly special by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a one-of-a-kind blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to ensure the perfect fit for any cozy reading session.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Ideal for book lovers on special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or simply as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any reading nook.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient cleaning.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable polyester fabric with a lightweight polyester fill.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Adult</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Items</th>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
